# Agent System Adapter — La PesquerApp

This repository has a tool-neutral agent system in `docs/agent-system/`.

Use it for workflows that previously existed only in Claude Code:

- GAP Discovery / Implementation / Audit
- Code audits
- UI desktop/mobile audits
- Mobile UI workflow
- Idea parking and promotion
- System learner / project memory

## Required sources

For non-trivial tasks, check:

- `AGENTS.md`
- `docs/agent-system/README.md`
- `docs/agent-system/commands/README.md`
- Relevant files in `docs/agent-system/rules/`
- Relevant files in `docs/agent-system/workflows/`

## Command mapping

When the user writes one of these commands, follow the matching workflow:

- `/audit-code quality|migrate|arch [scope]` → `docs/agent-system/workflows/code-audit.md`
- `/audit-mobile [scope]` → `docs/agent-system/workflows/ui-audit.md` in mobile mode
- `/audit-desktop [scope]` → `docs/agent-system/workflows/ui-audit.md` in desktop mode
- `/audit-design visual|copy|consistency [scope]` → `docs/agent-system/workflows/design-audit.md`
- `/mobile [view]` → `docs/agent-system/workflows/mobile-ui.md`
- `/idea [text]` or `/ideas` → `docs/agent-system/workflows/ideas.md`
- `/ideas promote [NNN]` → idea workflow, then GAP Discovery
- `crea un GAP`, `documenta este cambio` → GAP Discovery
- `implementa GAP-NNN` → GAP Implementation
- `audita GAP-NNN` → GAP Audit
- `recuerda esto`, `añade esto al sistema` → System Learner

## Claude Code boundary

Do not modify `.claude/**` by default.

Allowed only when explicitly invoked:

- GAP workflow may read/update `.claude/gaps/**` because it is still the active
  GAP store.
- Ideas workflow may read/update `.claude/ideas/parking-lot.md`.

Do not migrate, rewrite or delete Claude Code files unless Jose explicitly asks.

## Precedence

If generic AI guidance conflicts with La PesquerApp docs, follow La PesquerApp:

- Service layer and tenant rules from `docs/agent-system/rules/api-client.md`
- Form rules from `docs/ai-context/03-form-system.md`
- UI rules from `docs/agent-system/rules/design.md`
- Hook/query rules from `docs/agent-system/rules/hooks.md`
